WEBVTT

00:05:28.407 --> 00:05:31.827
Studying diet and its effect
on acne is complex,

00:05:31.869 --> 00:05:33.204
but the research suggests

00:05:33.245 --> 00:05:35.664
that the healthiest diet
for your body overall

00:05:35.706 --> 00:05:38.709
could also be the healthiest diet
for your skin.

00:05:38.709 --> 00:05:40.419
Our skin is an amazing organ,

00:05:40.419 --> 00:05:42.171
so let's remember to treat it right.

00:05:42.171 --> 00:05:44.924
Wear your sunscreen,
keep an eye on any moles

00:05:44.924 --> 00:05:47.676
and see a dermatologist
if there are any changes.

00:05:47.718 --> 00:05:49.845
And ignore those myths, OK?